{"id": "7th-t1-u1-099", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-kutriyalugaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurukkam-word-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கணப் பகுப்புகளையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I (இலக்கணப் பாகுபாடு):\nL1. மென்றொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்\nL2. இடைத்தொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்\nL3. முற்றியலுகரம்\nL4. குற்றியலிகரம்\nபட்டியல் II (சான்றுகள்):\nR1. மூழ்கு, மார்பு\nR2. சங்கு, பந்து\nR3. கேண்மியா, சென்மியா\nR4. புகு, பசு, மாவு"}], "options": {"A": "L1-R1, L2-R2, L3-R3, L4-R4", "B": "L1-R4, L2-R3, L3-R2, L4-R1", "C": "L1-R2, L2-R1, L3-R4, L4-R3", "D": "L1-R3, L2-R4, L3-R1, L4-R2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: மென்றொடர் - சங்கு, பந்து; இடைத்தொடர் - மூழ்கு, மார்பு; முற்றியலுகரம் - புகு, பசு, மாவு; குற்றியலிகரம் - கேண்மியா, சென்மியா. சரியான வரிசை: 2 - 1 - 4 - 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the grammatical classifications with their correct word examples:\nList I (Classification):\nL1. Men-thodar Kutriyalugaram\nL2. Idai-thodar Kutriyalugaram\nL3. Mutriyalugaram\nL4. Kutriyaligaram\nList II (Examples):\nR1. Moozhgu, Maarbu\nR2. Sangu, Pandhu\nR3. Kaelmiya, Senmiya\nR4. Pugu, Pasu, Maavu"}], "options": {"A": "L1-R1, L2-R2, L3-R3, L4-R4", "B": "L1-R4, L2-R3, L3-R2, L4-R1", "C": "L1-R2, L2-R1, L3-R4, L4-R3", "D": "L1-R3, L2-R4, L3-R1, L4-R2"}, "explanation": "Textbook match: Men-thodar=Sangu/Pandhu, Idai-thodar=Moozhgu/Maarbu, Mutriyalugaram=Pugu/Pasu/Maavu, Kutriyaligaram=Kaelmiya/Senmiya."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "மென்றொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்", "content_en": "Men-thodar Kutriyalugaram"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "இடைத்தொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்", "content_en": "Idai-thodar Kutriyalugaram"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "முற்றியலுகரம்", "content_en": "Mutriyalugaram"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "குற்றியலிகரம்", "content_en": "Kutriyaligaram"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "மூழ்கு, மார்பு", "content_en": "Moozhgu, Maarbu"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "சங்கு, பந்து", "content_en": "Sangu, Pandhu"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "கேண்மியா, சென்மியா", "content_en": "Kaelmiya, Senmiya"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "புகு, பசு, மாவு", "content_en": "Pugu, Pasu, Maavu"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 18, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "grammar_word_pairs"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_re