{"id": "7th-t1-u1-106", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-kutriyalugaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kutriyaligaram-punarchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குற்றியலிகரப் புணர்ச்சி விதியின்படி,\n'நாடு + யாது' என்பது நிலைமொழியும் வருமொழியும் இணையும் போது எவ்வாறு புணரும்?"}], "options": {"A": "நாடுயாது", "B": "நாடியாது", "C": "நாடாது", "D": "நாட்டியாது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: நிலைமொழி ஈற்றிலுள்ள 'டு' (ட் + உ) உகரம் குறைந்து, வருமொழி முதலாக வரும் யகரத்தின் காரணமாக இகரமாகத் திரியும் (ட் + இ = டி). எனவே 'நாடியாது' எனப் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the Kutriyaligaram Punarchi rule,\nHow does 'Naadu + Yaadhu' combine into a single term?"}], "options": {"A": "Naaduyaadhu", "B": "Naadiyaadhu", "C": "Naadaadhu", "D": "Naattiyaadhu"}, "explanation": "Textbook explanation: Terminal ugaram mutates into igaram before 'ya', yielding 'Naadiyaadhu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 19, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referenc